We need to create an testing Electron application for the bridge.
The application must be able to run on Windows, Linux and MacOS.
The application must be able to connect to the Ethereum contract
and the Acki Nacki contract.
The application must be able to deposit and withdraw tokens.
The application must be able to show the status of the deposit
and the withdraw.

- Acki Nacki logo must be used
- The application must be able to switch between different accounts
- The application must be able to show the balance of the user
- For new accounts the application must be able to create new wallet
- The application must be able to setup an account using seed (12 or 24 words)
- The application must be able to transfer secret information (withdrawal hash and nullifier_preimage)
to the another contract
-  The application must run in Sepolia testnet

So the application must demonstrate the usage of the bridge.
The design of the application is not important, it's functionality is important.